  "details": "I have a few private worlds that many people would love to be able to visit regularly, but they can't unless they save the URL or unless I'm online. I'd like to be able to allow certain players to join these private worlds, maybe while I develop them, etc. The whitelist could also just be something like \"the members of these specific VRChat Groups.\"\n\nBy extension, this should also allow users to set a private world as their home world if they're on its whitelist.\n\nFurthermore, it would be nice if there were also a checkbox to prevent users from joining using URLs if not on this whitelist, so that creators could create \"Patron/Supporter-Only\" worlds that can't just easily be shared with non-patrons.",
